<h3>Shooter Survey</h3>

  <p>What do you like about Shooter games?</p>
  <%= text_area_tag "responses[likes]", nil, placeholder: "Fast action, aiming skills, tactial squad coordination..." %>
  <p>How difficult should the Shooter game be?</p>
  <%= text_area_tag "responses[difficulty]", nil, placeholder: "Sweaty, casual-friendly, easy" %>
  <p>Will you be playing on a computer or on console?</p>
  <%= text_area_tag "responses[medium]", nil, placeholder: "Computer, PS5, Xbox" %>
  <p>What is your goal while playing the game?</p>
  <%= text_area_tag "responses[goal]", nil, placeholder: "become better at it, just relaxing" %>
  <%= submit_tag "Submit Survey" %>
